/-!
# Continuous-assurance trusted-base witness inventory

This import-only audit module has no declarations of its own.  Its explicit
`#print axioms` commands expose the trusted-base dependencies of every Lean
witness referenced by `continuous-assurance/architecture/trust.toml`.

The external architecture-audit executable checks this compiler output against
the closed allowed set `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`.  That
executable check remains evidence about a Lean kernel run; it is not itself a
Lean theorem.
-/

